<title>USA: Del Global Technologies Q4 net up.</title>
<headline>Del Global Technologies Q4 net up.</headline>
<dateline>VALHALLA, N.Y. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>For The Three Months Ended  For The Year Ended</p>
<p>		     08/03/96    07/29/95    08/03/96    07/29/95</p>
<p> Net sales     $14,390,000 $9,935,000 $43,745,000 $32,596,000</p>
<p>Income before provision for income taxes</p>
<p>		     1,509,000    616,000   4,309,000   2,743,000</p>
<p>Provision for income</p>
<p>  taxes		539,000    189,000   1,394,000     838,000</p>
<p> Net Income	  970,000    427,000   2,915,000   1,905,000</p>
<p>Per Share Amounts</p>
<p>Net income per common share  and common share equivalents,</p>
<p>on a primary and fully diluted</p>
<p>  basis		    .14	  .08	   .50	   .38</p>
<p>Weighted average number of common shares outstanding</p>
<p>and common share</p>
<p>equivalents (a)</p>
<p>		     7,066,642  5,126,677   5,934,221   5,217,540</p>
<p>(a)  Adjusted for 3% stock dividends declared November 20, 1995 and July 12, 1996.</p>
<p>Note: Full company name is Del Global Technologies Corp.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
